<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-σπένδω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pour upon</i> or <i>over</i>, esp. as a
			drink-offering, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ τοῦ βωμοῦ οἶνον
				κατὰ τοῦ ἱρηΐου ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.39
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνον ἐ. κατὰ τῶν κεφαλέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.62
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖσι ἱροῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.167
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεκρῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1395
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῖσδ᾽ ἐπ᾽ εὐχαῖς τάσδ᾽ ἐ.
				χοάς</span>
			<i>after</i> the vows I <i>pour</i> these libations, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				149
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.60
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἄν τι θύων</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἐπισπένδων ἄνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					161
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δάκρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					23.38
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>promise,
				pledge,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Leg.Gort.
				4.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.11
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, <i>accept in pledge</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.13
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Med.
			, <i>make a fresh treaty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.22
			</span></i>.</div>
